      "name": "InitializeGameStateFrame",
      "signature": "dword InitializeGameStateFrame(dword dwFrameId, void * pFrameData, dword dwFrameType, dword dwFlags, void * pContext, int nParam1, int nParam2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Initialize game state exception handling frame with SEH (Structured Exception Handling) protection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current exception list and link SEH exception frame (ExceptionList = &local_14)\n2. Retrieve frame data subsystem 1 via FUN_6fb9c171, store at offset 0x6c\n3. Retrieve frame data subsystem 2 via FUN_6fb9c171, store at offset 0x70\n4. Retrieve frame data subsystem 3 via FUN_6fb9c171 and extract additional metadata\n5. Store dwFrameId (param_1) at frame pointer offset 0x1b\n6. Store dwFrameType (param_3) at frame pointer offset 0x1c\n7. Mark initialization state (local_8 = 1 for \"in progress\")\n8. Call CallSettingFrameWithExceptionHandler to process frame with exception safety\n9. Clear initialization state (local_8 = 0xffffffff) on completion\n10. Invoke FUN_6fb9bdd5 cleanup handler\n11. Restore previous exception list and return result\n\nParameters:\ndwFrameId - Frame identifier, stored in frame subsystem at offset 0x1b\npFrameData - Generic frame data pointer, passed to exception handler\ndwFrameType - Frame type classification constant, stored at offset 0x1c\ndwFlags - Frame initialization flags (typically 0 on entry)\npContext - Context data passed to exception handler\nnParam1 - Parameter for exception handler callback\nnParam2 - Parameter for exception handler callback\n\nReturns:\nReturn value from CallSettingFrameWithExceptionHandler (uint status or data)\nOn exception: 0xffffffff written to local_8 before unwinding\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Uses SEH __except blocks to ensure cleanup on exception\n- Frame data passed as generic void* because it's opaque to caller\n- FUN_6fb9c171 returns subsystem pointers that are stored without validation\n- Exception frame setup at [EBP-0x10] follows SEH frame structure protocol\n- Three separate subsystem initialization calls must complete before handler invocation",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
